(A) box half-width R=3 (doubled coords): 225 h-variables, 300 xi-variables
    gauge-invariant local linear functionals supported in the box: dim = 15
    dir [1. 0. 0.]: largest singular value of all invariant symbols ~ eps^1.999;  max |w(k).G(k)| = 3.9e-16
    dir [0.707 0.707 0.   ]: largest singular value of all invariant symbols ~ eps^1.999;  max |w(k).G(k)| = 4.2e-16
    dir [0.267 0.535 0.802]: largest singular value of all invariant symbols ~ eps^1.999;  max |w(k).G(k)| = 3.2e-16

(B) random strongly invariant positive Hamiltonians (K = random SPD on pi, h only through invariants,
    plus a random pi-w cross term); physical frequencies vs k on 3 directions
    trial 0 dir [0.707 0.707 0.   ]: max physical omega ~ k^2.000  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.703e-04)
    trial 0 dir [0.267 0.535 0.802]: max physical omega ~ k^2.002  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.607e-04)
    trial 1 dir [0.707 0.707 0.   ]: max physical omega ~ k^2.001  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.472e-04)
    trial 1 dir [0.267 0.535 0.802]: max physical omega ~ k^2.000  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.206e-04)
    trial 2 dir [0.707 0.707 0.   ]: max physical omega ~ k^2.001  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.454e-04)
    trial 2 dir [0.267 0.535 0.802]: max physical omega ~ k^2.000  (omega at k=0.0125: 1.710e-04)

(C) control: weakly invariant spatial linearized-Einstein potential (K = identity)
    dir [0.707 0.707 0.   ]: max |V_EH| eigen on phys ~ k^1.999 => omega ~ k^1.000; weak-invariance residual |V G| = 8.7e-24
    dir [0.267 0.535 0.802]: max |V_EH| eigen on phys ~ k^1.999 => omega ~ k^1.000; weak-invariance residual |V G| = 4.3e-23
    |k|=0.100: ||V_EH|| = 6.612e-03, ||S||^2 (max size of any strongly invariant quadratic symbol per unit coefficient) = 3.443e-05
    |k|=0.050: ||V_EH|| = 1.653e-03, ||S||^2 (max size of any strongly invariant quadratic symbol per unit coefficient) = 2.154e-06
    => V_EH is O(k^2) while every strongly invariant symbol is O(k^4): V_EH is not strongly invariant.
